":200000,\"maxOutputTokens\":32000,\"canonicalModel\":\"claude-haiku-4-5\",\"provider\":\"firstParty\"},\"claude-sonnet-5\":{\"inputTokens\":46,\"outputTokens\":6898,\"cacheReadInputTokens\":1286637,\"cacheCreationInputTokens\":52198,\"webSearchRequests\":0,\"costUSD\":0.8027870999999999,\"contextWindow\":1000000,\"maxOutputTokens\":64000,\"canonicalModel\":\"claude-sonnet-5\",\"provider\":\"firstParty\"}},\"permission_denials\":[],\"terminal_reason\":\"completed\",\"fast_mode_state\":\"off\",\"fast_mode_disabled_reason\":\"sdk_opt_in_required\",\"subtype\":\"success\",\"api_error_status\":null,\"result\":\"## Summary\\n\\nFound the bug in `internal/cli/export.go`'s `BranchesFor` (the export selection path that groups sessions into `sessions/<branch>/` folders). It checked the session's raw metadata branch name *before* checking whether the checkpoint is reachable from the default branch, so a transcript recorded on a feature branch that later got merged stayed filed under `sessions/branches/<old-feature-branch>/` forever.\\n\\nPer Entire Brain history, the intended behavior is the opposite priority: check default-branch reachability first (so merged work joins the default-branch folder), and only fall back to the recorded metadata branch for genuinely unmerged work. `SourceBranch` was already correctly preserved elsewhere for provenance, so no other changes were needed.\\n\\nFix (`internal/cli/export.go`):\\n```go\\nfunc (d checkpointBranchDestinations) BranchesFor(checkpointID, metadataBranch string) []string {\\n\\tif d.DefaultBranch != \\\"\\\" && len(d.DefaultCheckpointIDs) > 0 {\\n\\t\\tif _, ok := d.DefaultCheckpointIDs[checkpointID]; ok {\\n\\t\\t\\treturn []string{d.DefaultBranch}\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t}\\n\\tbranch := strings.TrimSpace(metadataBranch)\\n\\tif branch != \\\"\\\" {\\n\\t\\treturn []string{branch}\\n\\t}\\n\\treturn []string{\\\"\\\"}\\n}\\n```\\n\\nValidation:\\n- `go build ./...` \u2014 passes\\n- `go test ./internal/cli/... -run 'Export|Branch|Snapshot|Checkpoint' -v` \u2014 passes\\n- `go test ./internal/cli/...` (full package) \u2014 passes\\n\\nOnly `internal/cli/export.go` was modified; `go.mod`/`go.sum` untouched.\",\"ttft_ms\":1373,\"ttft_stream_ms\":772,\"time_to_request_ms\":16,\"type\":\"result\",\"duration_ms\":237379,\"uuid\":\"79a6ea1c-66a1-4df9-a76e-36201dc669ec\"}\n",
